### Component 2: DX11 Hook (`core/src/hooks/`)

#### [NEW] [dx11_hook.cpp](file:///Users/vardanvanyan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/wow-injection-bot/core/src/hooks/dx11_hook.cpp)
- **Method:** Create a temporary D3D11 device + swap chain to get the vtable address of `IDXGISwapChain::Present`
- Hook `Present` (index 8 in DXGI vtable) using MinHook
- Our hooked `Present` runs every frame on WoW's main thread — this is where we:
  - Initialize ImGui (first frame)
  - Run the bot controller tick
  - Render the overlay
- Clean teardown on unload (unhook, restore original vtable)

#### [NEW] [input_hook.cpp](file:///Users/vardanvanyan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/wow-injection-bot/core/src/hooks/input_hook.cpp)
- Hook WoW's `WndProc` to intercept keyboard/mouse input for ImGui
- Toggle overlay visibility with a hotkey (e.g., `INSERT`)
- When overlay is visible, ImGui captures input; otherwise pass-through to WoW

