## Build System

- **CMake** (3.20+) with MSVC toolchain (Visual Studio 2022)
- Two build targets:
  - `injector.exe` — console app (Release x64)
  - `core.dll` — 64-bit DLL (Release x64, no CRT if possible for stealth)
- Build command: `cmake --build . --config Release`

